sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Istio as Istio Gateway<br/>VirtualService
    participant AuthzPolicy as Istio AuthorizationPolicy
    participant Proxy as Hub Proxy<br/>model-registry binary
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / MySQL
    participant Controller as Controller Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant BFF as BFF Server<br/>:4000
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443/HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant AsyncJob as Async Upload Job<br/>Python

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 1: Model Metadata Ingestion

    Client->>Istio: POST /api/model_registry/*<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    Istio->>AuthzPolicy: Validate source namespace + principal
    AuthzPolicy->>AuthzPolicy: Check: kubeflow namespace<br/>+ istio-ingressgateway SA<br/>+ authorization header present
    AuthzPolicy->>Proxy: Forward (mTLS)
    Proxy->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE model metadata<br/>GORM ORM
    DB-->>Proxy: Result
    Proxy-->>Istio: 200 OK
    Istio-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Controller,KServe: Flow 2: InferenceService Reconciliation

    KServe->>Controller: Watch event<br/>(INFERENCE_SERVICE_CONTROLLER=managed)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: List Services<br/>label: component=model-registry
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Registry service endpoint
    Controller->>Proxy: PUT serving URL<br/>OpenAPI HTTP client
    Proxy->>DB: UPDATE model metadata
    DB-->>Proxy: Result
    Proxy-->>Controller: 200 OK

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 3: UI Access Flow

    Client->>Istio: GET /model-registry/*
    Istio->>AuthzPolicy: Validate principal<br/>istio-ingressgateway SA
    AuthzPolicy->>BFF: Forward request
    BFF->>BFF: Authenticate<br/>Bearer token or internal SA token
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Authorization check
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Allowed/Denied
    BFF->>Proxy: Proxy API request
    Proxy-->>BFF: Model data
    BFF-->>Istio: HTML/JSON response
    Istio-->>Client: Response

    Note over AsyncJob,S3: Flow 4: Async Artifact Upload

    AsyncJob->>S3: Upload model artifacts<br/>boto3, HTTPS/443
    S3-->>AsyncJob: Upload complete
    AsyncJob->>Proxy: Update artifact metadata<br/>HTTP REST

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Flow 5: Controller Metrics

    K8sAPI->>Controller: GET :8443/metrics<br/>TLS + TokenReview + SAR
    Controller-->>K8sAPI: Prometheus metrics
